  "adaptations": [
    "Android device labels and User-Agent replace PS5-only branding in the imported adapters.",
    "IPv4-only transport behavior is retained only for the PS5 platform; Android may use IPv6.",
    "Torrent filesystem discovery excludes PS5 USB/data paths on Android.",
    "miniupnpc UPNP_GetValidIGD uses the pinned 2.2.8 seven-argument signature.",
    "The host-only NUVIO_TORRENT_LOCAL_FIXTURE build disables default public trackers; Android retains them. Host CMake does not enable DHT/UPnP.",
